{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift Highway: Retro Console Edition</strong> is an arcade dive into an endless highway, where 90s aesthetics meet high-speed thrills. Dash through neon cities and sunset landscapes in iconic cars, weaving between traffic. Breathe in the evening air, relax, and let the engine\u2019s roar merge with the rhythm of the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892780/extras/f06e584c722ce3b15e41ca673391ba04.poster.avif?t=1757056306\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892780/extras/f06e584c722ce3b15e41ca673391ba04.webm?t=1757056306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892780/extras/f06e584c722ce3b15e41ca673391ba04.mp4?t=1757056306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Multiple camera views</strong>:</u> Switch between hood, bumper, or third-person perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Soundtrack</strong>:</u> A full album of atmospheric liquid drum &amp; bass for total immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Variety</strong>:</u> Multiple tracks with unique moods and cars with distinct handling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Scoring &amp; traffic</strong>:</u> Earn points, dodge vehicles, avoid crashes \u2014 and keep moving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Aesthetics</strong>:</u> VHS filters, retro visuals, and the feel of a classic console game.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rookie Driver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892780/59d0b47d70da27096